Strip the web egress tools (PATCH_OUT_WEB_TOOLS, default 0 = kept).

Removes the registrations of web_search, web_fetch, agentic_fetch, fetch, and
download — the DuckDuckGo search (internal/agent/tools/search.go) and the
arbitrary-URL GET tools. Cutting the agentic_fetch block in buildTools
(internal/agent/coordinator.go) also makes the sub-agent-only web_search and
web_fetch unreachable. Tool files stay compiled (UI switches on their name
constants); only construction/registration is removed. See
tasks/reference/dependency-network-audit.md D1.

